{% comment %}
  The lab's services, as cards.

  Replaces the hand-written block that used to live inline in index.json. That
  version hardcoded absolute https://www.coastalfilmlab.com URLs and opened
  every one of them in a new tab, which piled up tabs for the visitor, split
  the analytics, and broke entirely on preview and development themes where
  the domain is not the live one.

  Every link here is resolved through the pages and collections drops instead,
  so it stays relative, follows the theme it is rendered on, and cannot rot
  into a 404 if a handle is edited — a missing page yields a blank url rather
  than a confident link to nowhere.

  Two tiers. The primary four keep the images and copy the old block used. The
  secondary row is text only: those services are real but low volume, and
  giving them cards of their own would flatten the difference between "most of
  our business" and "we also do this".

  Accepts:
    - heading {String} Optional heading above the primary row.

  Usage:
    {% render 'cfl-home-services', heading: 'What we do' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign film_dev = pages['film-development']
  assign buy_film = pages['buy-film']
  assign repair = pages['camera-repair']
  assign cameras = pages['cameras']
-%}

<div class="cfl-services">
  {%- if heading != blank -%}
    <h2 class="cfl-section-heading">{{ heading }}</h2>
  {%- endif -%}

  <ul class="cfl-services__grid scroll-trigger animate--slide-in" role="list">
    <li class="cfl-service-card">
      <a class="cfl-service-card__media" href="{{ film_dev.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0585/6093/8038/files/StandardC41Develop_Scan001_-_2x3_3acc9e36-f0ad-4e44-84a1-758d0913f1db.jpg?v=1726952872"
          alt=""
          loading="lazy"
          width="600"
          height="900"
        >
      </a>
      <div class="cfl-service-card__body">
        <h3 class="cfl-service-card__title"><a href="{{ film_dev.url }}">Film Processing</a></h3>
        <p class="cfl-service-card__desc">
          We develop film daily and deliver your scans over Google Drive. C-41 and black &amp;
          white, 35mm through large format.
        </p>
        <a class="button button--primary cfl-service-card__cta" href="{{ film_dev.url }}">
          Start an order
        </a>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li class="cfl-service-card">
      <a class="cfl-service-card__media" href="{{ buy_film.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0585/6093/8038/files/Buy_Film_4x6-01.jpg?v=1708547923"
          alt=""
          loading="lazy"
          width="600"
          height="900"
        >
      </a>
      <div class="cfl-service-card__body">
        <h3 class="cfl-service-card__title"><a href="{{ buy_film.url }}">Buy Film</a></h3>
        <p class="cfl-service-card__desc">
          Kodak, Ilford, CineStill, Lomography and more. 35mm, 110, medium format and large
          format, all in stock.
        </p>
        <a class="button button--primary cfl-service-card__cta" href="{{ buy_film.url }}">
          Shop film
        </a>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li class="cfl-service-card">
      <a class="cfl-service-card__media" href="{{ repair.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0585/6093/8038/files/Camera_Repair002.jpg?v=1715982783"
          alt=""
          loading="lazy"
          width="600"
          height="900"
        >
      </a>
      <div class="cfl-service-card__body">
        <h3 class="cfl-service-card__title"><a href="{{ repair.url }}">Camera Care</a></h3>
        <p class="cfl-service-card__desc">
          Light seal replacement and cleaning for film cameras. We don't take repairs in — if
          your camera needs more than that, we'll tell you straight rather than sell you a job.
        </p>
        <a class="button button--primary cfl-service-card__cta" href="{{ repair.url }}">
          Learn more
        </a>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li class="cfl-service-card">
      <a class="cfl-service-card__media" href="{{ cameras.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0585/6093/8038/files/Camera_LensesCover.jpg?v=1718398139"
          alt=""
          loading="lazy"
          width="600"
          height="900"
        >
      </a>
      <div class="cfl-service-card__body">
        <h3 class="cfl-service-card__title"><a href="{{ cameras.url }}">Camera Store</a></h3>
        <p class="cfl-service-card__desc">
          Film and digital cameras, lenses and accessories, every one of them tested and graded
          before it goes on the shelf.
        </p>
        <a class="button button--primary cfl-service-card__cta" href="{{ cameras.url }}">
          Shop cameras
        </a>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>

  {%- comment -%}
    Secondary services. Each entry is skipped if its page or collection is
    missing, so an unpublished page drops out rather than rendering a link to
    nothing. Photo Restoration is deliberately absent: the page exists in the
    admin but is unpublished.

    The whole card is the anchor rather than the title alone. That gives a much
    larger hit target, and it keeps the description out of link styling — an
    earlier version underlined the titles in browser-default blue, which is the
    exact trap the link rules at the top of cfl-components.css describe: the
    theme only colours links inside a listed set of prose containers, and
    anything written in a custom-liquid section outside that set falls through
    to the browser default.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="cfl-services__more">
    <h3 class="cfl-services__more-title">Also from the lab</h3>
    <ul class="cfl-services__more-list" role="list">
      {%- if pages['premium-processing'] != blank -%}
        <li>
          <a class="cfl-more-card" href="{{ pages['premium-processing'].url }}">
            <span class="cfl-more-card__title">Premium Processing</span>
            <span class="cfl-more-card__desc">Hand-edited scans, matched to your color profile</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if collections['scan-only'] != blank -%}
        <li>
          <a class="cfl-more-card" href="{{ collections['scan-only'].url }}">
            <span class="cfl-more-card__title">Scan Only</span>
            <span class="cfl-more-card__desc">Already developed? We'll digitize your negatives</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if collections['develop-only'] != blank -%}
        <li>
          <a class="cfl-more-card" href="{{ collections['develop-only'].url }}">
            <span class="cfl-more-card__title">Develop Only</span>
            <span class="cfl-more-card__desc">Negatives back, no scans, for your own setup</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if pages['archiving'] != blank -%}
        <li>
          <a class="cfl-more-card" href="{{ pages['archiving'].url }}">
            <span class="cfl-more-card__title">Archival &amp; Digitization</span>
            <span class="cfl-more-card__desc">Old family film, prints, slides, tape and video</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if pages['studio-rental'] != blank -%}
        <li>
          <a class="cfl-more-card" href="{{ pages['studio-rental'].url }}">
            <span class="cfl-more-card__title">Studio Rental</span>
            <span class="cfl-more-card__desc">Book our Tampa studio by the hour</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if pages['order-status'] != blank -%}
        <li>
          <a class="cfl-more-card" href="{{ pages['order-status'].url }}">
            <span class="cfl-more-card__title">Order Status</span>
            <span class="cfl-more-card__desc">Check where your film is right now</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
